      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "During the Japanese occupation, the naval base became a repair facility for the Imperial Japanese Navy before returning to British control in 1945.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Singapore_Naval_Base",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Sembawang Heritage Trail offers a 7‑kilometre walk that highlights historic landmarks, from the old Admiralty House to the former shipyard.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
