      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Sembawang’s black‑and‑white bungalows are among the last surviving examples of colonial architecture in Singapore, a rarity compared to the city’s modern HDB blocks.",
